message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below.
  The concept DOI always resolves to the latest release.
type: dataset
title: "Internacia Datasets: reference data of countries, intergovernmental organizations, and country groups"
authors:
  - name: "Dateno (Common Data Index)"
    website: "https://dateno.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/datenoio/internacia-db"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21452328
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.21452328
    description: "Zenodo concept DOI (resolves to the latest version)"
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"
version: 1.9.0
date-released: 2026-08-02
keywords:
  - countries
  - ISO 3166
  - intergovernmental organizations
  - reference data
  - entity linking
  - open data
abstract: >-
  Structured reference data for 256 countries and territories, 1085
  intergovernmental organizations and country groups (intblocks), and 86
  organization block types. Designed for entity linking, geographic
  classification, and membership joins. Data is licensed CC-BY-4.0; the
  build and validation code is licensed MIT (see LICENSE and DATA_LICENSE).
  The centroid field is derived from mledoze/countries (ODbL-1.0); see
  ATTRIBUTION.md for third-party source obligations.
